stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Anonymous
    Anonymous --> Authenticated: signup / login\n(bcrypt.compare, salt rounds=12)\nissues access(15m) + refresh(7d) cookies

    Authenticated --> Authenticated: request with valid access cookie\n(authenticate middleware verifies signature+expiry)

    Authenticated --> Refreshing: access token expired,\nrefresh cookie present
    Refreshing --> Authenticated: POST /auth/refresh\nverifies refresh token + tokenVersion match\nrotates both cookies
    Refreshing --> Anonymous: refresh token invalid/expired\nor tokenVersion mismatch (revoked)

    Authenticated --> Anonymous: POST /auth/logout\n(tokenVersion++, cookies cleared)
    Authenticated --> Anonymous: admin promotes/changes role\n(tokenVersion++ forces re-auth)
